msgid ""
"A native WhatsApp client written in Rust with egui. It connects through "
"whatsapp-rust. Messages are end-to-end encrypted on this device."
msgstr ""
"Um cliente nativo de WhatsApp escrito em Rust com egui. Ele se conecta pelo "
"whatsapp-rust. As mensagens são criptografadas de ponta a ponta neste "
"dispositivo."

#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:762
msgid "This is an unofficial client. See WhatsApp's terms of service."
